{"id":"365bea28fb7d89a0","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-plus-construction.md","title":"Definition — Plus Construction for a Presheaf","display":"Definition — Plus Construction for a Presheaf","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-plus-construction","aliases":["14-df-plus-construction"],"display":"Definition — Plus Construction for a Presheaf","depends_on":["[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]]","[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]","[[14-thm-covering-sieve-closure]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-plus-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-plus-construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Plus Construction for a Presheaf"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75f5f3e37180e81\" href=\"?note=b75f5f3e37180e81\" title=\"14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf\">14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55b5b594c94a4b33\" href=\"?note=55b5b594c94a4b33\" title=\"14-df-sieve-pullback\">14-df-sieve-pullback</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d09d6567cd8efb10\" href=\"?note=d09d6567cd8efb10\" title=\"14-thm-covering-sieve-closure\">14-thm-covering-sieve-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 是小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为预层。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,R\">\\(S,T,R\\)</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 上的筛；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x|_R=(x_f)_{f\\in R}\">\\(x|_R=(x_f)_{f\\in R}\\)</span> 是分量族限制。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:D\\to C\">\\(g:D\\to C\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^+\">\\(F^+\\)</span> 的箭头方向为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^+(C)\\to F^+(D)\">\\(F^+(C)\\to F^+(D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_C\">\\(\\sim_C\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_F(C)\\times P_F(C)\">\\(P_F(C)\\times P_F(C)\\)</span> 上定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(S,x),(T,y)\\in P_F(C)\">\\((S,x),(T,y)\\in P_F(C)\\)</span> 为其输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nP_F(C)\\coloneqq\\{(S,x)\\mid S\\in J(C)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)\\},\\\\\n(S,x)\\sim_C(T,y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R\\in J(C)\\ (R\\subseteq S\\cap T\\land x|_R=y|_R),\\\\\nF^+_0(C)\\coloneqq P_F(C)/{\\sim_C},\\\\\nF^+_1(g)\\coloneqq\\left(F^+_0(C),F^+_0(D),\n\\left([(S,x)]\\mapsto\\left[(\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(g,S),(x_{g\\circ h})_{h\\in\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(g,S)})\\right]\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F)\\coloneqq(F^+_0,F^+_1),\\\\\nu_F\\coloneqq\\left(F,\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F),\n\\left(\\left(F(C),F^+_0(C),\\left(s\\mapsto[(\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C),(F(f)(s))_{f\\in\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)})]\\right)\\right)\\right)_{C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nP_F(C)\\coloneqq\\{(S,x)\\mid S\\in J(C)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)\\},\\\\\n(S,x)\\sim_C(T,y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R\\in J(C)\\ (R\\subseteq S\\cap T\\land x|_R=y|_R),\\\\\nF^+_0(C)\\coloneqq P_F(C)/{\\sim_C},\\\\\nF^+_1(g)\\coloneqq\\left(F^+_0(C),F^+_0(D),\n\\left([(S,x)]\\mapsto\\left[(\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(g,S),(x_{g\\circ h})_{h\\in\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(g,S)})\\right]\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F)\\coloneqq(F^+_0,F^+_1),\\\\\nu_F\\coloneqq\\left(F,\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F),\n\\left(\\left(F(C),F^+_0(C),\\left(s\\mapsto[(\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C),(F(f)(s))_{f\\in\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)})]\\right)\\right)\\right)_{C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.5 The Associated Sheaf Functor，印刷页 128–133。覆盖筛有限交仍覆盖，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_C\">\\(\\sim_C\\)</span> 自反、对称、传递；逆像保持覆盖与交，保证箭头映射不依赖代表。筛的封闭性和相容族方程保证所写逆像族相容。复合逆像筛与相容族逐分量一致，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^+\">\\(F^+\\)</span> 为预层；单位 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_F\">\\(u_F\\)</span> 的自然性由预层复合律得到。所有商及分量集合均属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf","status":"resolved","id":"b75f5f3e37180e81","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"55b5b594c94a4b33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-covering-sieve-closure","status":"resolved","id":"d09d6567cd8efb10","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-covering-sieve-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"S,T,R","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"x|_R=(x_f)_{f\\in R}","display":false},{"tex":"g:D\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"F^+","display":false},{"tex":"F^+(C)\\to F^+(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim_C","display":false},{"tex":"P_F(C)\\times P_F(C)","display":false},{"tex":"(S,x),(T,y)\\in P_F(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nP_F(C)\\coloneqq\\{(S,x)\\mid S\\in J(C)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Match}_F(S)\\},\\\\\n(S,x)\\sim_C(T,y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R\\in J(C)\\ (R\\subseteq S\\cap T\\land x|_R=y|_R),\\\\\nF^+_0(C)\\coloneqq P_F(C)/{\\sim_C},\\\\\nF^+_1(g)\\coloneqq\\left(F^+_0(C),F^+_0(D),\n\\left([(S,x)]\\mapsto\\left[(\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(g,S),(x_{g\\circ h})_{h\\in\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(g,S)})\\right]\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F)\\coloneqq(F^+_0,F^+_1),\\\\\nu_F\\coloneqq\\left(F,\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F),\n\\left(\\left(F(C),F^+_0(C),\\left(s\\mapsto[(\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C),(F(f)(s))_{f\\in\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)})]\\right)\\right)\\right)_{C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\sim_C","display":false},{"tex":"F^+","display":false},{"tex":"u_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false}],"bytes":2019,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-plus-construction|Definition — Plus Construction for a Presheaf]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-plus-construction]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-plus-construction]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-plus-construction]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-plus-construction|Definition — Plus Construction for a Presheaf]]"},{"id":"5f5c83c7517a2504","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 是小站点，$F$ 为预层；$F^+=\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F)$、$F^{++}=\\mathrm{Plus}_J(F^+)$、$u_F$ 见 [[14-df-plus-construction]]。"}],"outgoing":["b75f5f3e37180e81","55b5b594c94a4b33","d09d6567cd8efb10","1bdaf4a293143165"]}